{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Answered:</b> 'We are not required' — we have no need to answer you, for our Elohim, whom we serve, is able, [even] in the land, to deliver us from the burning fiery furnace, and also from your hand if He so wills. And behold, if He does not deliver, it will be known to you."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:19:36.753612501Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}